                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6716ef94-4aae-3264-8f77-f22cba0a81b7",
                        "entry_id": "f169b75e-5741-36b3-8c88-2db479eb690b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "zabójstwo brata lub innego krewnego, także kogoś, z kim jest się związanym przyjaźnią, przynależnością do jednej grupy itp."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "literary"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a16aa7ce-3376-4995-87e6-4370263e5ffe",
                                "sense_id": "6716ef94-4aae-3264-8f77-f22cba0a81b7",
                                "text": "Z powodu twardego postępowania wobec pozostałych czeskich książąt, a może też w związku z bratobójstwem, otrzymał przydomek Okrutny"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "93dc200c-a311-40e3-b17f-1c47ca7a467c",
                        "source_entry_id": "f169b75e-5741-36b3-8c88-2db479eb690b",
                        "source_sense_id": "6716ef94-4aae-3264-8f77-f22cba0a81b7",
                        "target_lang_word": "fratricide",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fratricide",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c0c7081-dde5-379c-974a-250aa34aec52",
                                        "entry_id": "cd230097-2fb0-3f36-b2c2-cd05e49699f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The killing of one's brother (or sister)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aeeab1b8-8885-4101-9815-112c09403ad1",
                                                "sense_id": "2c0c7081-dde5-379c-974a-250aa34aec52",
                                                "text": "The new accusation brought by Urban against Manfred of murdering his sister-in-law's embassador – it may be observed that, tacitly, he acquits him of parricide, fratricide, and nepoticide – requires a little explanation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f1747c6-7a4f-4c70-9c1e-5c89f05f8b84",
                                                "sense_id": "2c0c7081-dde5-379c-974a-250aa34aec52",
                                                "text": "Terms related to familicide include filicide (the killing of one's child or children), uxoricide (the killing of one's wife), fratricide or sororicide (the killing of one's brother or sister), avunculicide (the killing of one's uncle), and nepoticide (the killing of one's nephew)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2f9cf616-6ede-3ae1-8269-86c36020ddfb",
                                        "entry_id": "cd230097-2fb0-3f36-b2c2-cd05e49699f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The intentional or unintentional killing of a comrade in arms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6c57ce0-182c-47f9-938d-2ce55da11ee2",
                                                "sense_id": "2f9cf616-6ede-3ae1-8269-86c36020ddfb",
                                                "text": "From January on, Third Army also spent a good deal of energy trying to solve the problem of fratricide, the killing or injuring of one's own forces by what is ironically called 'friendly fire,'[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e63ec28a-c88b-46db-9122-97e571559285",
                                                "sense_id": "2f9cf616-6ede-3ae1-8269-86c36020ddfb",
                                                "text": "Such a press of arms invites many opportunities for unintentional fratricide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84ef15c1-d895-3389-bceb-3bbf974c2f14",
                                        "entry_id": "cd230097-2fb0-3f36-b2c2-cd05e49699f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The undesirable situation where the separate missiles from a MIRV interfere with each other as they explode."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fratricide",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2634b08f-1742-3b0e-8072-8669a513ca75",
                                        "entry_id": "2919833a-ad2e-3399-87e7-e6d3c982799e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who commits fratricide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df5c5094-3f95-4cb2-bda1-eab5d25538dc",
                                                "sense_id": "2634b08f-1742-3b0e-8072-8669a513ca75",
                                                "text": "Can Signorio was twice a fratricide, the last time when he lay upon his death-bed: his tomb bears upon its gables the images of six virtues, — Faith, Hope, Charity, Prudence, and (I believe) Justice and Fortitude."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19707601-802a-4e69-9ecb-c49f646bb991",
                                                "sense_id": "2634b08f-1742-3b0e-8072-8669a513ca75",
                                                "text": "The conversion of Russia to Christianity was effected, it would seem by a monster of cruelty and lust. That Vladimir (980–1015) was a fratricide, who maintained 3,500 concubines, has not prevented his canonization as a saint."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1b9a678-f69d-4f21-a06f-41a1e1dcd5ed",
                        "source_entry_id": "f169b75e-5741-36b3-8c88-2db479eb690b",
                        "source_sense_id": "6716ef94-4aae-3264-8f77-f22cba0a81b7",
                        "target_lang_word": "fratricide",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fratricide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66221f1a-1800-3844-8976-c15823c71770",
                                        "entry_id": "dec667ff-3e7a-3c42-a499-a9db2566c800",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie les guerres ou les luttes sanglantes entre frères ou concitoyens."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95c2e2ff-22a1-4dbd-a109-d53a67813ea2",
                                                "sense_id": "66221f1a-1800-3844-8976-c15823c71770",
                                                "text": "Le Parti républicain se dirige vers des mois de luttes fratricides qui connaîtront leurs dénouements lors des élections de l’année prochaine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05496414-9e10-450d-8d03-af94d2b542cb",
                                                "sense_id": "66221f1a-1800-3844-8976-c15823c71770",
                                                "text": "Lutte fratricide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fratricide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8fb9928-8dad-3e57-a464-36b6fe208684",
                                        "entry_id": "a13e0d31-09fe-3e4d-a522-c6c08e3c1add",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui tue son frère."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82f59a39-e3eb-4462-a417-eab27e02a83f",
                                                "sense_id": "a8fb9928-8dad-3e57-a464-36b6fe208684",
                                                "text": "Caïn fut le premier fratricide."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24bf8c7c-5be3-41a3-9e2b-503f07aadc71",
                                                "sense_id": "a8fb9928-8dad-3e57-a464-36b6fe208684",
                                                "text": "[Rome fut] fondée et bâtie par un fratricide et formée par l'assemblage de femmes enlevées par force à leurs parents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fratricide",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdd972b0-3e13-3357-b19b-aeadea4fd505",
                                        "entry_id": "05ff90c0-13e9-3ed2-b2ae-1c26bc759d57",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Meurtre d’un frère."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1f0ea9f-db4a-4b94-8dda-374485d939f7",
                                                "sense_id": "cdd972b0-3e13-3357-b19b-aeadea4fd505",
                                                "text": "Tu t’es jeté sur mon épée, et voilà tout. Donc, aux yeux de Dieu et des hommes, je ne suis pas coupable du crime de fratricide ; donc tu n'as pas reçu une mission divine, mais infernale ; donc tu es sorti de la tombe, non comme une ombre sainte, mais comme un spectre maudit, et tu vas rentrer dans ta tombe."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
